/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  species/Tricine.dat -- ONE model species, ONE typed file: the fully dissociated form of Tricine.
  Made by bin/curate/species_c373.py from data/curation/batches/species_c373/*.tsv, which holds every
  reading (source, table, page, whether read from a page image).  Standard state: ideal solution at
  1 mol/kg, 298.15 K, H+ = 0.
  NO `aqueousThermo` ON PURPOSE: the ionisation (pK, dH) of this family is evaluated in a work in hand and is in chemistry/, so the SPECIATION is complete; the evaluated compilation prints ionisation quantities only (no formation enthalpy or entropy), and none was entered from another work in this pass, so a balance that needs the enthalpy of this species REFUSES BY NAME instead of borrowing a value.
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType modelSpecies;
schemaVersion 1;

name    Tricine;
formula     "C6H12NO5-";
charge  -1;
MW { value 178.164; unit g/mol;}
